    `o 19 r 30(4)(a) the record of appeal`
    `o 19 r 30(4)(b) the appellant's Case`
    `o 19 r 30(4)(c) the appellant's core bundle of documents`
    `o 19 r 30(4)(d) the appellant's bundle of authorities`

