GIVEN document IS A `o 19 r 30(4) document`
      `this is a case to which paragraph (5) applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the written judgment or grounds of decision (if any) and the extracted order of the lower Court are in a separate volume` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the document is filed` IS A DATE
      `the date the document is served` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 4 the last day as extended or shortened` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 19 r 30(4) the appellant's document is filed and served in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `this is a case to which paragraph (5) applies`
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Except for a case to which paragraph (5) applies"
        IF document EQUALS `o 19 r 30(4)(c) the appellant's core bundle of documents` AND NOT (`the written judgment or grounds of decision (if any) and the extracted order of the lower Court are in a separate volume`)
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the appellant’s core bundle of documents, with the written judgment or grounds of decision of the lower Court (if any) and the extracted order of the lower Court in a separate volume"
        IF NOT (`o 19 r 8(3) the filing and the service are done by the last day` `the date the document is filed` `the date the document is served` `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` `o 3 r 4 the last day as extended or shortened`)
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within 8 weeks after the date on which the Registry informs the parties that the record of proceedings is available" -- outside a period the text fixes in its own words
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

