      AND record's `o 19 r 30(5)(a)(v) the order granting permission to appeal to the Court of Appeal`
      AND record's `o 19 r 30(5)(a)(vi) the parties' Cases filed in the Appellate Division`
      AND record's `o 19 r 30(5)(a)(vii) all documents filed in the Appellate Division, so far as they are relevant to the matter decided and the nature of the appeal`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the appellant’s supplemental record of appeal comprising"

