    `o 19 r 31(2)(d) the Case sets out those submissions and the reasons for them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 19 r 31(2)(e)(i) in the concluding paragraphs, submissions on the appropriate costs orders to be made on appeal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 19 r 31(2)(e)(ii) in the concluding paragraphs, submissions on the amount of costs and disbursements that should be awarded in respect of all parties to the appeal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 19 r 31(2)(f) the name and signature of the respondent's solicitor` IS A BOOLEAN

