    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "on an application to the Court of Appeal to transfer an appeal that has been made to the Appellate Division, on the ground that it is more appropriate for the Court of Appeal to hear the appeal" -- an application or ground that is not met

